# Headers for static hosts that read public/_headers
# (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages — the file is copied into the build output as-is).
#
# WHO MAY PUT THIS GAME IN AN IFRAME: CrazyGames, and nobody else.
#
# This is the "sitelock" half of the CrazyGames requirements. frame-ancestors
# has to be a real HTTP header — browsers ignore it inside a <meta> tag — which
# is why it lives here and not in index.html.
#
# The list below is CrazyGames' own exhaustive whitelist, not a guess:
#   · every regional portal (crazygames.fr, .no, .jp, …)
#   · games.crazygames.com, where video ads run and where the app's game frame
#     lives
#   · the two app origins, scheme included. This matters: a bare host such as
#     *.crazygames.com inherits the scheme of the document, so it allows https
#     ancestors only — the iOS app is served from capacitor:// app.crazygames.com
#     and would otherwise render a white screen with no JavaScript error.
#   · frame-ancestors is checked against EVERY ancestor, and in the apps the
#     game sits in a frame on games.crazygames.com which is itself framed by the
#     app, so both have to be listed.
# Sources: docs.crazygames.com/resources/html5/sitelock
#
# Note for the CrazyGames submission itself: a game uploaded as a file bundle
# is served from game-files.crazygames.com, where this file is not read. There,
# the protection is the JavaScript hostname check they document — deliberately
# not implemented here, because it blanks the game on the owner's own domain and
# on the preview host.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://*.crazygames.com https://www.crazygames.com https://www.crazygames.fr https://www.crazygames.co.id https://www.crazygames.cz https://www.crazygames.dk https://www.crazygames.hu https://www.crazygames.nl https://www.crazygames.no https://www.crazygames.pl https://www.crazygames.com.br https://www.crazygames.ro https://www.crazygames.fi https://www.crazygames.se https://www.crazygames.ru https://www.crazygames.com.ua https://www.crazygames.at https://www.crazygames.jp https://www.crazygames.pt https://www.crazygames.vn https://www.crazygames.com.vn https://www.crazygames.co.kr https://games.crazygames.com https://app.crazygames.com capacitor://app.crazygames.com
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# The maps and the car models are immutable once built: cache them hard.
/maps/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/models/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/tex/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The icons and the Draco decoder can change; keep them fresh-ish.
/draco/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
